#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-color 544> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 544 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 545> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 545 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
