msgid "The <if ($n1 == 0)><ui-color 542><ui-edge-color 543>Falcons</ui-edge-color></ui-color><else><ui-color 544><ui-edge-color 545>Ravens</ui-edge-color></ui-color></if>' alliance <string $s1> (soaring high) was wiped out!"
